# SPA fallback for the vendored concept sites (2026-11-21): each concept
# is a client-side-routed SPA, so a direct load / refresh / bookmark of a
# sub-route must serve the SPA's index with a 200, not the main site's
# 404 page.
#
# WHY LITERAL RULES (do not "simplify" these back to a splat):
# - A splat rule (/concepts/<slug>/*) also matches the SPA's own asset
#   files (/concepts/<slug>/assets/*.js), because Cloudflare Pages
#   applies _redirects even when a static file exists — the bundles
#   then come back as HTML and the SPA cannot boot. (Verified live
#   2026-11-21: directory-destination splat rules fixed deep links but
#   returned HTML for every concept JS bundle; reverted in 86d2a34.)
# - A rewrite to an index.html file can never work either: Pages
#   308-redirects any request for */index.html to its directory, so a
#   static 200 rule 308s and a splat rule whose destination matches its
#   own source 404s. The destination here is therefore the directory
#   URL (trailing slash), which serves the SPA's index with a 200.
#
# MAINTENANCE: every rule below names one real route from the concept's
# router (see each concept's src/App.tsx — tally-bar, look-out-below,
# stitch-and-tan, portfolio-concept). If a concept gains a route, add
# its literal rule here; anything not listed keeps the main site's 404.
# product-site has no router, so it has no rules.
#
# tally-bar (routes: shop, specs, apps, cart, checkout, orders/:id, support, styleguide)
/concepts/tally-bar/shop  /concepts/tally-bar/  200
/concepts/tally-bar/specs  /concepts/tally-bar/  200
/concepts/tally-bar/apps  /concepts/tally-bar/  200
/concepts/tally-bar/cart  /concepts/tally-bar/  200
/concepts/tally-bar/checkout  /concepts/tally-bar/  200
/concepts/tally-bar/orders/:id  /concepts/tally-bar/  200
/concepts/tally-bar/support  /concepts/tally-bar/  200
/concepts/tally-bar/styleguide  /concepts/tally-bar/  200
# look-out-below (routes: play, tutorial, characters, press, devlog, devlog/:slug, styleguide)
/concepts/look-out-below/play  /concepts/look-out-below/  200
/concepts/look-out-below/tutorial  /concepts/look-out-below/  200
/concepts/look-out-below/characters  /concepts/look-out-below/  200
/concepts/look-out-below/press  /concepts/look-out-below/  200
/concepts/look-out-below/devlog  /concepts/look-out-below/  200
/concepts/look-out-below/devlog/:slug  /concepts/look-out-below/  200
/concepts/look-out-below/styleguide  /concepts/look-out-below/  200
# stitch-and-tan (routes: shop, shop/:slug, custom, story, styleguide)
/concepts/stitch-and-tan/shop  /concepts/stitch-and-tan/  200
/concepts/stitch-and-tan/shop/:slug  /concepts/stitch-and-tan/  200
/concepts/stitch-and-tan/custom  /concepts/stitch-and-tan/  200
/concepts/stitch-and-tan/story  /concepts/stitch-and-tan/  200
/concepts/stitch-and-tan/styleguide  /concepts/stitch-and-tan/  200
# portfolio-concept (routes: work/:slug, about)
/concepts/portfolio-concept/work/:slug  /concepts/portfolio-concept/  200
/concepts/portfolio-concept/about  /concepts/portfolio-concept/  200
